The fragment shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.uniform_api.value.initial.render.basic_array.ivec4_vertex as dEQP-GLES2 (VK-GL-CTS 93bca01) writes it for a vertex case (the varying alone; the same file as tools/mali/testdata/deqp_vsuniarr_bvec4.frag). Plan #387 item vsunifarr-design, docs/notes/mali-vsuarr-lowering.md.
